    <div class="disclaimer-box">
        <p><strong>ENTERTAINMENT &amp; PARTY GAME DISCLAIMER:</strong> NeuralVox is designed strictly for social entertainment, party game fun, and simulation purposes. It does not provide certified forensic, legal, or medical polygraph lie detection capabilities. The vocal tremor calculations and evaluations are intended solely for party gameplay among friends.</p>
